# Entropy agent contract

Before any product or UI change:

1. Read `AGENTS.md`
2. Read `PRODUCT.md`
3. Read `DESIGN.md`

Follow those documents over habit or generic SaaS patterns.

## Non-negotiables (summary)

- Local-first: never own/import user files; workspace = folder; notes = Markdown on disk
- Palette: `#131413` `#FAFAF9` `#FFFFFF` `#E7E6E3` `#6B6D69` `#EEF2F8` `#6A7BA2`
- Font: Geist only (Inter solely if Geist unavailable); Geist Mono for paths/sizes
- Shared App sidebar across Notebook + Library; light-first Figma shell
- Notebook: no Linked/extra side panels; context/inspector hides when empty
- Library perspectives: Folders, Gallery, Large Files, Duplicates, Recent
- Layout: resizable panels, remembered, collapsible
- Lucide icons; calm 150–200ms motion
- Protected OS paths: never trash/rename/move/write under system trees; skip them in duplicates/storage scans
